<title>MOROCCO: Gas explosion kills six, wounds five in Morocco.</title>
<headline>Gas explosion kills six, wounds five in Morocco.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six Moroccans were killed and five wounded after five domestic gas containers exploded on Thursday in a snack bar in the business city of Casablanca, the official MAP news agency reported.</p>
<p>MAP said the explosion in the residential area of Anfa set fire to a nearby house and a shop which took the firemen five hours to extinguish.</p>
</text>
